# Packages for the zot flavor (OCI registry backed by the local Garage S3 store).
#
# Short on purpose: this layer sits on top of s3-garage, which already brought
# xfsprogs, nvme-cli, smartmontools, awscli2 and the diagnostics, and podman came
# from the base. Neither server is an RPM — both run as Quadlet containers.

# --- Talking to the registry from the box itself -------------------------
skopeo # the smoke test: skopeo copy / list-tags against localhost:5000

# --- Config handling -----------------------------------------------------
jq # configure.sh validates /etc/zot/config.json with it at BUILD time, so a
   # stray comma fails the build instead of the boot; also the obvious way to
   # read zot's JSON API on the device

# --- Credentials ---------------------------------------------------------
httpd-tools # REQUIRED: zot-setup calls htpasswd -bB to mint the admin account.
            # bcrypt is the only hash zot accepts, and -B is how you get it.
